keywords:
  - FDA
  - 510(k)
  - predicate device
  - medical device recalls
  - data engineering
abstract: >-
  A versioned graph of FDA 510(k) predicate relationships extracted from
  510(k) summary documents, linked to FDA recall records, with every link
  traced to its source page and extraction accuracy measured by era.
